0..60 Comment "//! This source shows wildcards in value and type positions."
61..64 Comment "//!"
65..144 Comment "//! A wildcard stands for a term that equations force. A hole is for the author"
145..157 Comment "//! to fill."
158..161 Comment "//!"
162..241 Comment "//! The elaborator binds a most general solution only where a comparison forces"
242..318 Comment "//! it. The checker writes the solution in place of the wildcard. The kernel"
319..379 Comment "//! readmits the declaration as if an author wrote the term."
380..383 Comment "//!"
384..460 Comment "//! - see: `corpus/pathological/holes/wildcard.gandr` — wildcard refusals."
461..476 Comment "//! - see: #528"
477..532 Comment "//! - see: #1979 — `endForced`, `endSigned`, `endMet`"
